From f9966c8d3b53cbab640a34cff33d00558884ca3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:44:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] nng: port existing FlatBuffers RPC and ordered validation
 events

Port the maintained Lotus/Logos NngInterface schema and existing public
bitcoinsuite-bitcoind-nng consumer contract, including historical blocks,
raw transaction and undo slices, complete spent coins, mempool bootstrap,
mining templates/status, and ordered validation notifications. Preserve
12-byte topics followed directly by FlatBuffers payloads. BCHN keeps its
80-byte headers, ordinary txids, CashTokens bytes and native consensus.

Provide an explicitly separate optional legacy RPC endpoint for Tobias's
2021 PluginInterface schema and all seven original methods, including
SubmitBlock/SubmitTx. Its union discriminants and hash layouts differ, so
mixing both dialects on one endpoint would be ambiguous. Submission uses
BCHN's existing validation paths and synchronized submitblock catcher.
Legacy pub/sub is not claimed; the maintained evolved schema is primary.

Capture mempool input coins before asynchronous callbacks can lose them,
translate conflict removals before connected-block events for existing
consumers, and drain callbacks/stop joined request workers before teardown.
Bound requests, slices and snapshots, preserving existing error numbers
and appending explicit parameter/resource failures. Keep the build default
OFF, independent of Chronik, ZeroMQ and mining/mempool policy changes.

Add an optional compatibility probe pinned to unmodified public Rust client
d425f277 and its Cargo lockfile; preserve Tobias's original RPC test fixture
and both schema provenance records. Native regtest covers bootstrap, raw
and undo offsets, CashTokens, parent/child spends, conflicts, reorgs,
mining-template reconstruction and NNG block submission, restart and bind
failure. Fix the independent C-identifier lint false positive without
allowing unsafe strerror-family calls, with executable lint regressions.

Based-on: Lotus/Logos src/nng_interface in V1 source 0b7939e926b8353ad09d8edc47f355ddacc30502
Based-on: LotusiaStewardship/bitcoinsuite d425f277debbddfb0b9ebdc7e737c1c0c56c6dac
Based-on: EyeOfPython/bitcoin-cash-node 11b5e3c46b1e0520ed849af458ed4f38e88eb02f

Separate the validation admission hook declaration from lifecycle headers to
avoid a module dependency cycle. Format translated initialization diagnostics
through a fixed literal using BCHN's existing std::string translation API.
Use standard bracket includes for CMake-generated interface headers.
